# What is kept out of the build context for docker/probe-agent.Dockerfile.
# BuildKit picks this file up by its name. The agent is built from a handful
# of paths (see the COPY lines); the rest only slows the build down, and a
# database or local settings must never get near an image.

node_modules
.next
out
build
dist
coverage
*.tsbuildinfo

data
probe-agent-data
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db.*
**/*.bak
**/*.pem
.env*

.git
.github
.claude
.vscode
docs
public
*.md
